keiko 1
# K3, the visible Checking state — the row reports Checking while the ping is
# held and the released verdict is Set/not checked, never Invalid.
# Excluded: the field's greyed editing state (the observation exposes no field
# colour), live Accepted/Rejected verdicts.
fault key-check hold
setting play.text_speed 0

activate title.settings
activate settings.key
type "sk-nano-0123456789abcdef"
press Enter
expect surface settings
expect control settings.key label "Checking…"
release-key-check
expect control settings.key label "Set — sk-nano-…cdef · not checked (see the log)"
